['Wrong formation or outside AppendixA','Mw or generic magnitude substituted for ML','Location uncertainty crosses threshold boundary','Event outside active fracturing interval','Multiday operation interval includes an actual stop','Source not shown available to licensee at relevant time','Written consent or other operative authorization exists','Completion/cleanup activity mistaken for injection','Revised earthquake solution or well coordinates'],
['Operative order and case-specific scope','Licence/UWI/operator history and mapped well/depth','Actual stage/day or finer injection and cessation/restart evidence','Applicable magnitude type, event time/location/uncertainty','Evidence of licensee recording or source availability','Original written consent or sufficiently complete consent record'],
